+The12-pair saved check independently validated40 new histories and271320 coordinates, with342930 predicates. The24-pair saved check validated60 new histories and885780 coordinates, with983426 predicates. The original-four saved check covered20 histories and39900 coordinates. Full-stream structural schema was explicitly reused; these checks do not claim that every original native residual entry was independently regenerated. Forward-coordinate certification is not inverse coefficient-C certification and does not by itself bound action leakage.
+
+The physical compression sequence used5.97+11.97+21.25=39.19 external seconds. This cumulative figure excludes distinct action and saved-check jobs. The four-pair action used3.28 seconds and its saved check2.54 seconds. Twelve and24 saved checks used3.11 and8.05 seconds. The separate fresh-width diagnostic used0.87 seconds. Original external receipts, sampled whole-tree peaks and source identities are retained; no new physical execution occurred in packaging.
